      "expectedSkills": ["tdd-implementation"],
      "expected": {
        "usesObservableInteractionContract": true,
        "avoidsPrivateCallAssertions": true,
        "keepsOneBehaviorPerCycle": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "successive-design-feedback",
      "prompt": "basic accountの料金計算は実装済みです。確定したtest listの順に、trialは無料、goldは既存のFeePolicyで計算、suspendedは課金拒否を返すbehaviorをTDDで足してください。現行関数には料金判断と監査ログ出力が同居しています。",
      "input": {
        "fixture": "agents/fixtures/tdd",
        "copyCommand": "test ! -e \"$TMPDIR/tdd-design-eval\" && cp -R agents/fixtures/tdd \"$TMPDIR/tdd-design-eval\"",
        "baselineCommand": "cd \"$TMPDIR/tdd-design-eval\" && PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python -m unittest -v",
        "verificationCommand": "cd \"$TMPDIR/tdd-design-eval\" && PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 python verify.py",
        "canonicalFixtureReadOnly": true
      },
      "expectedSkills": ["tdd-implementation"],
      "expected": {
        "concretizesOneTestListItemAtATime": true,
        "keepsEachSliceWithOneActorAndChangeReason": true,
        "usesGreenPainAsDesignEvidence": true,
        "separatesPricingFromAuditResponsibility": true,
        "doesNotMistakeDeduplicatedAuditCallForResponsibilitySplit": true,
        "preservesExistingCaseTestAndBehavior": true,
        "usesExistingFeePolicyBeforeNewAbstraction": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "single-case-without-extension-axis",
      "prompt": "確定仕様どおり、既存formatterへmarkdown出力を一種類だけ追加してください。差し替え契約や後続formatの要件はありません。TDDで進めてください。",
